# Seminary Division

Master of Divinity (96 credit hours)

Requires a secular Bachelor's degree

Optional degree programs for previous education

Life experience credit for full-time Christian workers

In some cases, depending on previous education, a degree may be earned by submitting a thesis or dissertation. GCITS honors credits transferred from qualified Bible colleges and seminaries.
